boundary"}},{"from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.boundary-vs-reality-check","id":"notes.psychology.boundary-vs-reality-check","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":29,"column":11,"offset":1498},"end":{"line":29,"column":46,"offset":1533},"indent":[]},"value":"notes.psychology.npd-definition"},{"from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.trifurcated-model-narcissism","id":"notes.psychology.trifurcated-model-narcissism","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":27,"column":11,"offset":1801},"end":{"line":27,"column":46,"offset":1836},"indent":[]},"value":"notes.psychology.npd-definition"},{"from":{"fname":"zettel.psychology.npd-ecosystem","id":"zettel.psychology.npd-ecosystem","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":27,"column":3,"offset":1895},"end":{"line":27,"column":38,"offset":1930},"indent":[]},"value":"notes.psychology.npd-definition"}],"anchors":{"narcissistic-personality-disorder-npd-as-an-exploitation-system":{"type":"header","text":"Narcissistic Personality Disorder (NPD) as an Exploitation System","value":"narcissistic-personality-disorder-npd-as-an-exploitation-system","line":15,"column":0,"depth":1},"core-concept":{"type":"header","text":"Core Concept","value":"core-concept","line":17,"column":0,"depth":2},"layers-of-impact":{"type":"header","text":"Layers of Impact","value":"layers-of-impact","line":22,"column":0,"depth":2},"healthy-narcissism-vs-npd":{"type":"header","text":"Healthy Narcissism vs NPD","value":"healthy-narcissism-vs-npd","line":28,"column":0,"depth":2},"the-danger-of-social-labeling":{"type":"header","text":"The Danger of Social Labeling","value":"the-danger-of-social-labeling","line":36,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":[],"parent":"k7whujrtxo2tvftwjvbq1jh","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"narcissistic-personality-disorder-npd-as-an-exploitation-system\">Narcissistic Personality Disorder (NPD) as an Exploitation System<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#narcissistic-personality-disorder-npd-as-an-exploitation-system\"></a></h1>\n<h1 id=\"narcissistic-personality-disorder-npd-as-an-exploitation-system-1\">Narcissistic Personality Disorder (NPD) as an Exploitation System<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#narcissistic-personality-disorder-npd-as-an-exploitation-system-1\"></a></h1>\n<h2 id=\"core-concept\">Core Concept<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#core-concept\"></a></h2>\n<p>NPD bukan sekadar \"terlalu cinta diri sendiri\" atau ego yang besar. Inti dari gangguan ini adalah ketika kebutuhan akan pengakuan berubah menjadi <strong>sistem eksploitasi</strong>.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Atomic Idea</strong>: NPD adalah ego yang membuat orang lain membayar biaya psikologisnya.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"layers-of-impact\">Layers of Impact<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#layers-of-impact\"></a></h2>\n<p>Gangguan kepribadian ini tidak hanya berdampak secara internal, tapi merusak ekosistem sosial dalam tiga lapisan:</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Individu</strong>: Masalah pada pola pikir, regulasi emosi, dan perilaku.</li>\n<li><strong>Relasi</strong>: Dampak negatif pada keluarga, pasangan, teman, dan rekan kerja.</li>\n<li><strong>Produktivitas</strong>: Mengganggu kinerja, stabilitas ekonomi, dan pertumbuhan manusia.</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"healthy-narcissism-vs-npd\">Healthy Narcissism vs NPD<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#healthy-narcissism-vs-npd\"></a></h2>\n<p>Ada perbedaan mendasar antara ciri narsistik yang sehat dengan gangguan NPD. Berdasarkan <strong>Trifurcated Model of Narcissism</strong>, narsisme terdiri dari tiga dimensi: Agentik, Antagonis, dan Neurotik.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Narsisme Sehat</strong>: Dominan pada sisi <em>Agentic Extraversion</em> (ambisi, percaya diri) namun rendah pada <em>Antagonism</em>. Seperti \"api kompor\" yang menggerakkan prestasi tanpa merusak orang lain.</li>\n<li><strong>NPD</strong>: Terjadi ketika <em>Antagonism</em> tinggi, terlepas dari apakah orang tersebut tampak percaya diri (Agentik) atau rapuh (Neurotik). Seperti \"api yang membakar rumah\" yang menghanguskan ekosistem sosial demi citra diri.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>See also: <a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.psychology.trifurcated-model-narcissism\">Trifurcated Model of Narcissism</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"the-danger-of-social-labeling\">The Danger of Social Labeling<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#the-danger-of-social-labeling\"></a></h2>\n<p>Penting untuk membedakan antara \"ciri kepribadian\" dan \"gangguan kepribadian\". Label klinis tanpa asesmen profesional berisiko menjadi <strong>senjata moral</strong> untuk menghakimi orang yang sekadar menyebalkan atau memiliki konflik komunikasi.</p>\n<p>See also: <a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">notes.psychology.boundary (Private)</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">psychology (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">npd (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">mental-health (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<strong>Backlinks</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.psychology.boundary-vs-reality-check\">Boundary vs Reality Check</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.psychology.trifurcated-model-narcissism\">Trifurcated Model of Narcissism</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.psychology.npd-ecosystem\">NPD as a Social Ecosystem Disruptor</a></li>\n</ul>","noteIndex":{"id":"root","title":"Hello and Welcome! 👋","desc":"","updated":1778468084907,"created":1724251163400,"tags":["x","twitter"],"custom":{"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"root","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"fbada016be66dbd4790f7e49ede05b67","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.x","alias":"x","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.x"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.twitter","alias":"twitter","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.twitter"}}],"anchors":{"find-more":{"type":"header","text":"Find More","value":"find-more","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":["book-summaries","daily","handbook","notes","tags","til","zettel"],"parent":null,"data":{},"body":"\nWelcome to the homepage! I use Dendron to store and organize notes, ideas, and experiments I’m working on. Here are the main sections you’ll find on this site:\n\n1. **Learning Notes** — Practical notes on programming, recent technologies, and productivity tips.\n2. **Personal Projects** — Summaries of projects, experiments, and outcomes I’m working on or have completed.\n3. **Writings & Opinions** — Casual articles and reflections about technology, daily life, and other interesting topics.\n\nI’m constantly experimenting and learning. I hope the content here helps you as a reference, a starting point for discussion, or just light reading.\n\n> Why Dendron?\n>\nDendron helps keep notes organized. Its \"seed\" and \"vault\" concepts make it easy to structure content and find what you need.\n\n## Find More\n\nIf you want to learn more or connect, check these links:\n\n- [Homepage (Dendron)](https://zeihanaulia.github.io/sotoy/)\n- [My GitHub](https://github.com/zeihanaulia)\n- [My Twitter / X](https://x.com/zeihanaulia)\n\nThanks for stopping by. If you have feedback or want to chat, feel free to reach out.\n"},"collectionChildren":null,"cu